# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Method chuoi goi tren BIEU THUC (khong phai tren mot bien).

`s.split(",")` chay; `s.strip().split(",")` va `xs[0].split(",")` truoc day
bao "'<bieu thuc>.split(...)' khong phai method chuoi da biet".

Nguyen nhan: `_compile_str_method_on_expr` chi tra `_STR_METHODS` - bang CU,
la nhanh du phong. CHIN method dang ky kieu MOI khong nam trong do:
center/count/ljust/match/rjust/search/split/title/zfill.

CANH BAO CHO NGUOI SUA: ban va "hien nhien" (cho duong bieu thuc tra THEM
registry) BIEN DICH QUA va CHAY nhung tra ve RAC - xem docs/BUGS_TODO.md.
Phai doi chieu KET QUA voi CPython, khong tin viec compiler het bao loi.

CPython that tra 3122."""


def demo(s: "str") -> "i32":
    # (a) ben nhan la KET QUA MOT LOI GOI
    a = s.strip().split(",")
    # (b) ben nhan la mot phan tu CHI SO
    b = a[0].strip()
    # (c) method 'dang ky kieu moi' can local an, tren bieu thuc
    c = s.strip().count(",")
    return len(a) * 1000 + len(b) * 100 + c * 10 + 2
